./analysis/cross_agent_screening_agreement_current_3ds_2gpt/unstable_reasoning_cases.csv:2:benchmark:5,GeneGPT: Augmenting Large Language Models with Domain Tools for Improved Access to Biomedical Information,benchmark_boundary_case,EXCLUDE|EXCLUDE|EXCLUDE|EXCLUDE|INCLUDE,EXCLUDE,application_wrapper,,,,,,"GeneGPT augments an existing LLM (Codex) with NCBI API tools to answer genomics questions, making it an application wrapper rather than a primary generative text-bio foundational model. | GeneGPT is a method that augments an existing LLM (Codex) with NCBI APIs, not a new generative model. The paper does not propose a generative architecture or foundation model; it is an application wrapper.",EXCLUDE,application_wrapper,,,,,,"The paper augments an existing LLM (Codex) with NCBI API tools for question answering, making it an application wrapper rather than a primary generative text-bio foundational model. | GeneGPT is a method that augments an existing generative LLM (Codex) with NCBI Web APIs for genomics question answering; it does not introduce a new generative model or foundation model, making it an application wrapper.",EXCLUDE,application_wrapper,,,,,,"GeneGPT augments an existing LLM (Codex) with NCBI Web APIs to answer genomics questions, which is an application wrapper around an external LLM, not a primary generative text-bio foundational model. | The paper describes GeneGPT as a method that augments an existing generative LLM (Codex) with NCBI Web APIs for genomics question answering, which is an application wrapper rather than a primary generative text-bio foundational model.",EXCLUDE,application_wrapper,,wrapper_boundary,answering genomics questions,none,augmented decoding algorithm that can detect and execute API calls,"The abstract describes GeneGPT as a method that augments an existing LLM (Codex) with API calls to answer genomics questions, without introducing a new multimodal generative model. Hence it is a wrapper of a foundation model, and the text‑bio bridge is limited to tool use rather than a central multimodal model.",INCLUDE,,,,,,,"The abstract describes GeneGPT, a novel method that augments an LLM with NCBI API calls to answer genomics questions, indicating a substantive natural‑language component and a direct text‑to‑biology bridge centered on genomic data. | The abstract presents GeneGPT with an augmented decoding algorithm that generates answers and triggers API calls, confirming a generative architecture, and leverages a large language model across eight biomedical tasks, indicating foundation-model-like breadth.",wrapper_boundary;generative_boundary
./analysis/cross_agent_screening_agreement_current_3ds_2gpt/unstable_reasoning_cases.csv:3:1198,Big Bird: Transformers for Longer Sequences,exclude_uncertain_unstable,UNCERTAIN|EXCLUDE|UNCERTAIN|EXCLUDE|EXCLUDE,UNCERTAIN,EC2_no_substantive_text_bio_bridge,bio_modality_unclear,,,,,"The abstract presents BigBird as a general NLP transformer improvement with a mention of genomics applications but no central biological modality or text-bio bridge; bio modality is unclear from the abstract. | The abstract describes an encoder-only sparse attention transformer (BigBird) for longer sequences, referencing BERT and tasks like question answering and summarization, but does not mention any generative mechanism such as decoder, autoregressive, or diffusion. Therefore it is not a generative model.",EXCLUDE,EC1_no_bio_modality,,clear_exclude,NLP tasks such as question answering and summarization,none,none,Abstract presents a transformer architecture for NLP without biological modality or explicit generative mechanism. Excluded under EC1_no_bio_modality.,UNCERTAIN,,bio_modality_unclear,thin_abstract_boundary,NLP tasks such as question answering and summarization,none,none,"Text component is clear from NLP tasks, but bio modality is only hinted by 'genomics data' without specification, no text-bio bridge described, and generative status is unclear as the model is an attention mechanism not explicitly generative.",EXCLUDE,EC2_no_substantive_text_bio_bridge,,clear_include,improves performance on various NLP tasks such as question answering and summarization,none,none,"BigBird introduces a new transformer architecture (primary model) with NLP tasks (text component) and mentions genomics applications (bio modality), but provides no explicit text‑bio integration or generative decoder, so it is included as a primary model without a text‑bio bridge or generative component.",EXCLUDE,EC2_no_substantive_text_bio_bridge,,,,,,"The abstract presents BigBird as a new transformer model with NLP improvements (text component) and mentions novel applications to genomics data (bio modality), but provides no explicit description of a text‑bio mapping or bridge. | BigBird is presented as a sparse-attention transformer improving long‑context NLP tasks; the abstract contains no mention of decoder, autoregressive or other generative mechanisms. It highlights broad applicability to many NLP tasks and genomics, indicating foundation‑model‑like breadth.",thin_or_truncated_abstract;text_component_boundary;generative_boundary
