nts Pro2RNA, a new multimodal generative model that integrates protein and taxonomy text representations to produce mRNA sequences, satisfying primary model status, biological modality, text component, and a substantive text‑bio bridge. | Pro2RNA is presented as a multimodal reverse‑translation language model that generates mRNA coding sequences, integrating pretrained models (ESM2, SciBERT, RNA LM), indicating a generative architecture with foundation‑model characteristics.",text_component_boundary;generative_boundary;biological_token_only
