w model that reformulates omics data into natural‑language question‑answer pairs and uses a pretrained LLM, providing clear evidence of a substantive text‑bio bridge. | The abstract presents CellHermes as an encoder, predictor, and explainer without mentioning a decoder or any generative mechanism, so it is not a generative model; however, it leverages pretrained LLMs and claims broad applicability, providing foundation‑model evidence.",wrapper_boundary;text_component_boundary;generative_boundary
