es a new multimodal model that uses instruction tuning (natural‑language) to condition DNA sequence generation, linking cell‑context biology with text prompts. | The title and abstract explicitly mention conditional DNA regulatory sequence generation using large language models and pretraining on extensive DNA text corpora, indicating a generative architecture with foundation-model characteristics.",thin_or_truncated_abstract;text_component_boundary;generative_boundary
