 "wrapper_boundary", "decision_rationale": "The paper describes GeneGPT as a method to augment existing LLMs (Codex) with NCBI Web APIs for genomics question answering, not as a new generative model; it is an application wrapper around a generative model."}, "round-A_architecture_reviewer_paper_type": "application_wrapper", "round-A_architecture_reviewer_generative_model_present": "no", "round-A_architecture_reviewer_foundation_model_evidence": "unclear", "round-A_architecture_reviewer_primary_exclusion_code": "application_wrapper", "round-A_architecture_reviewer_uncertainty_reason": "none", "round-A_architecture_reviewer_evidence_for_text_component": "not_assessed", "round-A_architecture_reviewer_evidence_for_text_bio_bridge": "not_assessed", "round-A_architecture_reviewer_evidence_for_generative_model": "none", "round-A_architecture_reviewer_boundary_case": "wrapper_boundary", "round-A_architecture_reviewer_decision_rationale": "The paper describes GeneGPT as a method to augment existing LLMs (Codex) with NCBI Web APIs for genomics question answering, not as a new generative model; it is an application wrapper around a generative model.", "pilot_roundA_scope_gate": "EXCLUDE", "pilot_roundA_architecture_gate": "EXCLUDE", "pilot_needs_adjudication": false}
