ue, disease) but no natural-language text component, thus failing the text component criterion.","{""paper_type"": ""application_wrapper"", ""generative_model_present"": ""yes"", ""foundation_model_evidence"": ""unclear"", ""primary_exclusion_code"": ""application_wrapper"", ""uncertainty_reason"": ""none"", ""evidence_for_text_component"": ""not_assessed"", ""evidence_for_text_bio_bridge"": ""not_assessed"", ""evidence_for_generative_model"": ""synthesize complete single-cell RNA-seq profiles from metadata"", ""boundary_case"": ""wrapper_boundary"", ""decision_rationale"": ""The abstract presents PGL as using a large language model to generate cell profiles, indicating an application wrapper around an existing model rather than a new foundation model.""}",application_wrapper,yes,unclear,application_wrapper,none,not_assessed,not_assessed,synthesize complete single-cell RNA-seq profiles from metadata,wrapper_boundary,"The abstract presents PGL as using a large language model to generate cell profiles, indicating an application wrapper around an existing model rather than a new foundation model.",EXCLUDE,EXCLUDE,True,"{""paper_type"": ""primary_model_paper"", ""bio_modality_present"": ""yes"", ""text_component_present"": ""no"", ""text_bio_bridge_present"": ""no"", ""generative_model_present"": ""yes"", ""foundation_model_evidence"": ""unclear"", ""primary_exclusion_code"": ""EC2_no_text_component"", ""uncertainty_reason"": ""none"", ""evidence_for_text_component"": ""none"", ""evidence_for_text_bio_bridge"": ""none"", ""evidence_for_generative_model"": ""synthesize complete single-cell RNA-seq profiles"", ""boundary_case"": ""clear_exclude"", ""decision_rationale"": ""The abstract presents a generative model for single-cell transcriptomes using an LLM, but input is categorical metadata (tissue, disease) not natural-language text, so text component is absent; excluded per EC2_no_text_component.""}",primary_model_paper,yes,no,no,yes,unclear,EC2_no_text_component,none,n