./data/docling_graph_screening_evidence_full_2026-07-10_gpt54mini_direct_nolimits_16shards/shard_04/full_2026-07-06__rec_003095/full_2026_07_06_rec_003095_docling_json_20260710_023551/docling/document.json:11306:      "orig": "[59] Hongru Shen, Jilei Liu, Jiani Hu, Xilin Shen, Chao Zhang, Dan Wu, Mengyao Feng, Meng Yang, Yang Li, Yichen Yang, et al. Generative pretraining from large-scale transcriptomes for single-cell deciphering. Iscience , 26(5), 2023.",
